---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Building Extelligence."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-black pt-16 pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-white text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/40 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-white/65 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Who we are</h2>
          <p>Building Extelligence is an AI-powered building energy simulation platform. This policy covers data collected through our website and waitlist form.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">What we collect</h2>
          <p>When you sign up for our waitlist, we collect your name, work email address, company, and any optional information you choose to share. We also collect standard website analytics (pages visited, browser type, approximate location).</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">How we use it</h2>
          <p>We use your information to send you product updates, early access invitations, and occasional news about Building Extelligence. We will never sell your data or share it with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Your rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data at any time. To do so, or to unsubscribe from our emails, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@buildingextelligence.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">hello@buildingextelligence.com</a> or use the unsubscribe link in any email we send.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Data storage</h2>
          <p>Your data is stored securely via HubSpot. We retain it only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes above.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions? Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@buildingextelligence.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">hello@buildingextelligence.com</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
